# reference spells by keeping bits 0..3 and 7 and adding each lane's base. ShuffleHigh / Low
# permute the upper / lower four words of each 128-bit lane with one control for all lanes.
# PermuteVar32x16 indexes the whole register, the x2 form the 64 words of the lower:upper pair
